  "fullDescription": "Rewind to the glory days of analog tape and VHS video packaging with PLAYBACK! Inspired by vintage VCR cassette sleeves and retro screen displays, this pixelated display font captures the crisp, blocky geometry of classic 80s and 90s technology. It instantly gives your typography an authentic lo-fi tech aesthetic and nostalgic analog feel.\n\nWhether you’re crafting retro synthwave album covers, pixel art video games, VHS-style film posters, 80s/90s party flyers, tech apparel prints, sticker packs, or custom Cricut and Silhouette vinyl craft SVG projects, PLAYBACK hits record on timeless retro style!",
